title: Preserve published dependencies in item-covered changelog windows
description: "Review follow-up: published tag v2026.11.11 includes dependency PRs 191, 189, 186, 187, 188 that default tracker regeneration omits when the release window contains closed items. The pinned generator only enriches such windows when dependency-updates is enabled. Updating package scripts or generator behavior is outside this tracker-only synchronization."
